{"articleNo":"203205","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_02.do?mode=view&articleNo=203205&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[교외행사] [국제] 2019 스키캠프 참가 신청 안내 (마감)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2019.01.24","hit":"12809","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #000000\">국제교류교육원에서는 겨울 스키캠프를 다음과 같이 계획하고 있습니다<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #000000\">.<!--?xml:namespace prefix = \"o\" ns = \"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\" /--><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #000000\">총</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #000000\"> 40</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #000000\">명의 참가자를 선착순으로 지원</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #000000\">받을 </span>예정이니 참여를 원하는 학생들은 <strong>다음주 월요일<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #000000\">, 1</span>월<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #000000\"> 28</span>일 낮 12시까지 </strong>국제교류교육원행정실을 방문하여 참가비를 납부해주시기 바랍니다<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #000000\">. <o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #000000\"><o:p>- 참가비 납부시 참가자의 키, 신발사이즈, 스키레슨참가 여부 작성&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span><span style=\"COLOR: #000000\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p></o:p></span><span style=\"COLOR: #000000\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #000000\">1. 대상: 본교 재학중인 외국인 유학생 및 2018학년도 국제교류도우미(일반 재학생들은 1월 24일 목요일&nbsp;부터 신청가능</span></o:p></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><o:p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #000000\">)</span></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #000000\">2. 날짜<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"COLOR: #000000\">: 2019</span>년<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"COLOR: #000000\"> 1</span>월<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"COLOR: #000000\"> 31</span>일 목요일<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"COLOR: #000000\">3. 장소</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"COLOR: #000000\">: </span><span style=\"COLOR: #000000\">무주 덕유산 리조트</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><span style=\"COLOR: #000000\">(</span><a href=\"https://www.mdysresort.com/\"><span style=\"COLOR: #000000\">https://www.mdysresort.com</span></a><span style=\"COLOR: #000000\">)</span><o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span>&nbsp;</p><table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr style=\"HEIGHT: 31.4pt; mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes\"><td width=\"608\" style=\"BORDER-TOP: black 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 31.4pt; BORDER-RIGHT: black 1pt solid; WIDTH: 456.3pt; BACKGROUND: #f5dca8; BORDER-BOTTOM: black 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 5.1pt; BORDER-LEFT: black 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 5.1pt\" colspan=\"2\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"VERTICAL-ALIGN: baseline; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%\"><span style=\"COLOR: black\">■ 참가비<span lang=\"EN-US